      "text": "Hi, my name is Shamir Ahmed. I am the executive director of the Data Economy Policy Hub or the Deb Hub. Hi, I am Mina Lisco, Director of Move Beyond Consulting. With our global South perspective, we bring insights today based on our work on Gen AI for sustainable futures, from green digital transitions to global digital justice. Our discussion today is based on the thematic track 3, the technical is social. Even though we are focusing on sub-theme, sustainable futures and environmental impact, we think it's crucial to also have a holistic approach and consider the other sub-themes as part of the track. Namely, AI as social systems, human agency and algorithmic coloniality. These are all interconnected with sustainable futures and environmental impact.",
